              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जत्रेत एक गायक शूर सरदाराचा पोवाडा गात होता. jatret ek gāyak śūr sardārācā povāḍā gāt hotā. At the fair a singer was singing a ballad of a brave chieftain."
